<title>MALAYSIA: Jaya Tiasa stock surges on requotation.</title>
<headline>Jaya Tiasa stock surges on requotation.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of timber firm Jaya Tiasa Holdings Bhd surged on its requotation on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Around 20 minutes into the market's opening, the stock was up 23.73 percent, or 2.80 ringgit at 14.60 on the most active volume of 1.18 million shares traded.</p>
